. capture noisily ssc2 snapshots     // canary: exists only in the rewrite
Snapshots of the SSC archive are stored as date-stamped git tags
(YYYY-MM-DD) in the mirror repository:
    https://github.com/labordynamicsinstitute/ssc-mirror/tags

  - daily snapshots exist from 2021-12-21 onward, with occasional
    gaps listed in the mirror's ERRATA
  - three earlier snapshots exist: 2017-08-10, 2021-04-15, 2021-08-10
  - date(latest) uses the most recent mirrored state

The mirror location can be overridden with the from() option,
the Stata global SSC2_MIRROR, or the environment variable of
the same name (see help ssc2).

Example:  ssc2 install reghdfe, date(2022-01-07)

