--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
package reghdfe from http://fmwww.bc.edu/repec/bocode/r
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

TITLE
      'REGHDFE': module to perform linear or instrumental-variable regression absorbing any
        number of high-dimensional fixed effects

DESCRIPTION/AUTHOR(S)
      
       reghdfe fits a linear or instrumental-variable regression
      absorbing an arbitrary number of categorical factors and
      factorial interactions Optionally, it saves the estimated fixed
      effects.
      
      KW: regression
      KW: instrumental variables
      KW: fixed effects
      KW: high dimension fixed effects
      
      Requires: Stata version 11.2 and ftools from SSC (q.v.)
      
      Distribution-Date: 20260111
      
      Author: Sergio Correia, Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System
      Support: email sergio.correia@gmail.com
      
      Author: Noah Constantine, Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System
      Support: email
      

